### Home
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Haslo123"
}

### Confirm account
# Token weź z odpowiedzi rejestracji
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/confirm?token=WKLEJ_TOKEN

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Haslo123"
}

### Fetch raw events from demo scraper
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/import/events/fetch
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### Normalize raw events and add them to catalog
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/import/events/normalize
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### Rebuild search index from catalog
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search-index/rebuild
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### Search events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?phrase=koncert&location=Teatr%20Polski&sortBy=DATE&direction=ASC&page=0&size=10

### Get filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/filters

### Catalog published events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalog/events

### Add manual catalog event as draft
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/events
Authorization: Bearer admin-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spektakl teatralny",
  "description": "Opis wydarzenia dodanego przez administratora",
  "placeName": "Teatr Polski",
  "city": "Wrocław",
  "address": "ul. Gabrieli Zapolskiej 3",
  "startDate": "2026-07-20T18:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-07-20T20:00:00Z",
  "category": "TEATR",
  "organizerName": "Teatr Polski",
  "organizerWebsite": "https://example.com"
}

### Publish event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/events/ID_WYDARZENIA/publish
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### Delete event
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/events/ID_WYDARZENIA
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### Add published event to search index
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search-index/events/ID_WYDARZENIA
Authorization: Bearer admin-token
